            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.083,
            0.883,
            0.14
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Sudarshan: We use iron metal to make these items. We also use wood to prepare handles wherever required. Additionally, we use coal in our furnaces to heat the iron."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.141,
            0.882,
            0.179
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Sudarshan is heating an iron block in the furnace. It has become red hot. He starts beating it hard with a hammer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.255,
            0.18,
            0.783,
            0.2
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Anandi is amazed and asks, “Why are you beating it?”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.255,
            0.202,
            0.741,
            0.22
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Sudarshan: I am beating it to shape it into an axe."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.222,
            0.882,
            0.26
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Anandi: Wow, a piece of iron can be beaten into a flat shape! Can we do this with other metals as well?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.261,
            0.882,
            0.3
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You may also have many such questions — let us "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "explore",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " what else we can do with metals."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.271,
            0.318,
            0.671,
            0.344
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4.1 Properties of Materials"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.271,
            0.375,
            0.503,
            0.399
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4.1.1 Malleability"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.273,
            0.418,
            0.54,
            0.44
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity 4.1: Let us explore",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.213,
            0.454,
            0.882,
            0.489
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Caution",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "— Conduct this activity under the supervision of your teacher or an adult."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.492,
            0.882,
            0.548
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Collect some waste pieces of copper and aluminium, an iron nail, a piece of coal, a pea-sized lump of sulfur (gandhak), and a block of wood."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.552,
            0.885,
            0.628
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Recall the chapter ‘Materials Around Us’ in the Grade 6 Science textbook Curiosity and "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "observe",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " the appearances of the above items. Are they lustrous? Also, note whether they are hard or soft and "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "record",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " your observations in Table 4.1."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.632,
            0.546,
            0.85
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 14,
              "bbox": [
                0.112,
                0.632,
                0.546,
                0.85
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_1_image_14.jpg",
              "content": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "image_caption",
              "index": 15,
              "bbox": [
                0.161,
                0.859,
                0.516,
                0.877
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Fig. 4.2: Beating an iron nail with a hammer"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.57,
            0.634,
            0.883,
            0.709
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, place each of these items one by one on any hard surface and beat them with a hammer (Fig. 4.2)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.571,
            0.713,
            0.883,
            0.789
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What do you think will happen? Do the objects become slightly flattened or do they break into pieces?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.571,
            0.792,
            0.883,
            0.83
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Record your observations in Table 4.1."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 19,
